---
title: Pesto Pasta
portions: 2
category: Pasta
source: "Genovese style"
---

## Pesto ->&pesto

[Toast] Toast the @pine-nuts{30 g} in a #dry pan{} for ~{3 min}.

[Blend] In a #food processor{}, blitz the @basil{50 g}, the toasted @pine-nuts{30 g}, the @parmesan{40 g}, the @garlic{1} and the @olive-oil{80 ml} to a paste. ->&pesto{}

## Pasta

[Boil] Cook the @pasta{200 g} in #salted water{} for ~{10 min}.

[Toss] Toss the drained pasta with the &pesto and a splash of cooking water.
